{"resourceIdentifier":"2503","resourceName":"Liling LFG Power Generation Project","description":"Liling LFG Power Generation Project (hereinafter referred to as the Project) is located at Liling landfill in Zhuanbukou village,Chashan town, Liling city, Hunan province, P.R China. The purpose of the project is to utilize landfill gas (LFG), which consists mainly of methane, for electricity generation. It includes LFG collection system, LFG pre-treatment system and electricity generation system. LFG collected will be used for electricity generation with internal combustion generators. The total installed capacity of the project will be 3.201 MW. The project started construction on 25-May-2020 and operated on 12-Oct-2020. \r\nIn absence of the project, equivalent amount of electricity exported to the grid by the project would have otherwise been supplied by Central China Power Grid (CCPG). Greenhouse gas (GHG) emissions will be reduced by avoiding CO2 emissions from those fossil fuel-based power plants connected to the grid and by avoiding GHG emissions from releasing LFG into atmosphere at the landfill site.","location":{"latitude":27.644717,"longitude":113.411531},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2021-05-12","endExclusive":"2021-06-12","endInclusive":"2021-06-11"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2503"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Hunan Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Zhuzhou Xinzhongshui Environmental Protection Technology Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Hunan Province, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2503"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"96472"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"typ